            "type": "TextBlock",
            "text": "AmmoLand, readable in full for the first time in weeks, says the court held ATF’s frame-and-receiver rule unconstitutional “as applied to Defense Distributed, SAF, and covered members” — “significant, but it is not nationwide.” Monday’s edition described a universal vacatur.",
